  {
    "name": "read_file",
    "description": "Read a local document in the current access scope. Text uses byte offset + returned next_offset and fingerprint, not line numbers. DOCX uses paragraph offset; CSV uses row offset; PDF uses zero-based page offset. XLSX uses sheet/range. SQLite runs read-only SQL; formulas and macros never execute. Images return actual image content.",
